<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Thumbnail Factory</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg:#F2E9DA; --card:#FFFDF9; --ink:#221E19; --dim:#77706A; --accent:#E8833A;
    --line:#E0D5C2; --reject:#B0432E; --ok:#3E7C4F; --gold:#B07F1A;
  }
  * { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:"Avenir Next","Helvetica Neue",system-ui,sans-serif; }
  .wrap { max-width:1220px; margin:0 auto; padding:26px 18px 90px; }
  h1 { font-size:29px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.02em; }
  h1 .dot { color:var(--accent); }
  .sub { color:var(--dim); font-size:13.5px; margin-top:4px; }

  .tabs { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:30; display:flex; gap:8px; background:var(--bg); padding:14px 0 12px; margin-bottom:8px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  .tab { font:inherit; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; padding:9px 20px; border-radius:999px; border:2px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); color:var(--ink); cursor:pointer; }
  .tab[aria-selected="true"] { background:var(--ink); border-color:var(--ink); color:#FFF9F1; }
  .page { display:none; }
  .page.active { display:block; }

  h2 { font-size:19px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin:38px 0 2px; }
  .h2sub { font-size:13px; color:var(--dim); margin-bottom:16px; }

  .gen { margin:22px 0 6px; display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .gen .tag { font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.06em; text-transform:uppercase; background:var(--ink); color:#FFF9F1; border-radius:5px; padding:3px 9px; }
  .gen .note { font-size:12.5px; color:var(--dim); }

  .row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:15px; }
  @media (max-width:900px){ .row { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); } }
  @media (max-width:600px){ .row { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .item img { width:100%; display:block; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(50,38,24,.14); }
  .item.dim img { opacity:.55; filter:saturate(.7); }
  .item.approved img { box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--ok), 0 5px 18px rgba(50,38,24,.18); }
  .cap { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:7px; margin-bottom:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .st { font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.05em; text-transform:uppercase; border-radius:5px; padding:2px 7px; color:#FFF9F1; }
  .st.current { background:var(--ok); }
  .st.approved { background:var(--accent); }
  .st.superseded { background:var(--dim); }
  .st.rejected { background:var(--reject); }
  .cap .t { font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; }
  .cap .d { font-size:12px; color:var(--dim); }

  .comp { margin-bottom:34px; }
  .comp .chead { display:flex; align-items:baseline; gap:9px; margin-bottom:5px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .comp .subs { font-size:11px; font-weight:800; background:var(--accent); color:#FFF9F1; border-radius:5px; padding:2px 8px; }
  .comp .cname { font-size:16px; font-weight:700; }
  .comp .star { color:var(--gold); font-size:15px; }
  .comp p { font-size:13px; line-height:1.55; margin:4px 0 10px; max-width:920px; }
  .comp p b { color:var(--dim); font-size:11.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.04em; }
  .comp img { width:100%; display:block; border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 5px 18px rgba(50,38,24,.14); }

  .cols { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:20px; margin-top:14px; }
  @media (max-width:760px){ .cols { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
  .panel { border-radius:13px; padding:16px 19px; border:2px solid var(--line); background:var(--card); }
  .panel h3 { font-size:13px; font-weight:800; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.06em; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .panel ul { list-style:none; }
  .panel li { padding:8px 0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; }
  .panel li:first-child { border-top:none; }
  .panel li strong { display:block; }
  .panel li span { color:var(--dim); font-size:12.5px; }
  .foot { margin-top:34px; font-size:12px; color:var(--dim); border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-top:14px; }
  .foot code { font-family:"SF Mono",Menlo,monospace; font-size:11.5px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <h1>Thumbnail Factory<span class="dot">.</span></h1>
  <p class="sub">One page. Left tab: how my thumbnails evolved, by archetype. Right tab: the 28 competitor channels the system learned from.</p>

  <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab" id="t-mine" role="tab" aria-selected="true" onclick="show('mine')">My Thumbnails</button>
    <button class="tab" id="t-comp" role="tab" aria-selected="false" onclick="show('comp')">Competitors ({{ competitors|length }})</button>
  </div>

  <div class="page active" id="p-mine">
    {% for cat in categories %}
    <h2>{{ cat.name }}</h2>
    <div class="h2sub">{{ cat.note }}</div>
    {% for gen_key, gen_label, gen_note, rows in cat.gen_groups %}
    <div class="gen"><span class="tag">{{ gen_label }}</span><span class="note">{{ gen_note }}</span></div>
    <div class="row">
      {% for r in rows %}
      <div class="item {{ 'dim' if r.status in ('superseded','rejected') else '' }} {{ 'approved' if r.status == 'approved' else '' }}">
        <div class="cap"><span class="st {{ r.status }}">{{ r.status }}</span><span class="t">{{ r.title }}</span><span class="d">{{ r.detail }}</span></div>
        <img src="{{ r.uri }}" alt="{{ r.title }}" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
    {% endfor %}

    <h2>Open items</h2>
    <div class="h2sub">Split by what blocks each one.</div>
    <div class="cols">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3 style="color:#2E6CB0">Waiting on you</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Scope Map redesign</strong><span>Benched since you rejected it; needs a direction before anything new is rendered.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Pointing poses: keep or retire</strong><span>Gen 5 fixed the layout (word centred on the finger) — your call whether they stay in rotation.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Mascot corner mark</strong><span>Every template has the slot; no asset chosen, so it renders empty.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Paid-lane go</strong><span>GPT Image 2 (fal) is built and never fired; each run needs your spend approval, ~$0.02-0.25/image.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>Not run yet</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Face poses: skeptical, shush</strong><span>Smile and both pointing directions exist; these two are still missing from the pack.</span></li>
          <li><strong>GPT Image 2 / augmented-lane renders</strong><span>Zero produced — also blocked by the spend decision.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Frame extraction for other videos</strong><span>Only “Cowork vs Claude Code” has been mined for payloads.</span></li>
          <li><strong>First real publish + Notion logging</strong><span>Archetype→CTR correlation starts on the first thumbnail that ships.</span></li>
          <li><strong>MediaPipe upgrade</strong><span>Would replace Haar face detection + geometric fingertip inference with real landmarks and 21-point hand tracking.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="foot">This page is generated, not hand-built. Rebuild it with
      <code>.claude/skills/thumbnail-factory/scripts/build_review_page.py</code>;
      content lives in <code>output/thumbnails/review/manifest.json</code>. Add entries there — never create another page.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="page" id="p-comp">
    <h2>The 28 channels behind the playbook</h2>
    <div class="h2sub">Your four favourites (★) first, then by size. Sheet labels: views · outlier multiple vs that channel's average; yellow OUT = 1.5x+. Positions 1-10 are recent uploads, 11-15 all-time outliers.</div>
    {% for c in competitors %}
    <div class="comp">
      <div class="chead">
        <span class="subs">{{ c.subs }} subs</span>
        <span class="cname">{{ c.name }}</span>
        {% if c.pinned %}<span class="star">★</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <p><b>Style:</b> {{ c.style }} <b>Outliers:</b> {{ c.outliers }}</p>
      <img src="{{ c.sheet }}" alt="{{ c.name }} thumbnails" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  function show(which) {
    document.getElementById('p-mine').classList.toggle('active', which === 'mine');
    document.getElementById('p-comp').classList.toggle('active', which === 'comp');
    document.getElementById('t-mine').setAttribute('aria-selected', String(which === 'mine'));
    document.getElementById('t-comp').setAttribute('aria-selected', String(which === 'comp'));
    window.scrollTo({ top: 0 });
  }
</script>
</body>
</html>
